aft Calculation","Current Model Treatment":"Five-city Estimates linked; Value Type remains Estimate","Remaining Need":"Not Final Approved Input; mandatory city sensitivity"},"evidence_record_id":null},{"input_key":"decision:DEC-ASM-OSHC-ALL-01","scope_type":"decision","scope_id":"DEC-ASM-OSHC-ALL-01","value":{"Decision Register ID":"DEC-ASM-OSHC-ALL-01","Record Type":"Assumption","Original ID":"ASM-OSHC-ALL-01","Decision / Assumption":"OSHC method","Current Status":"Approved - Nursing Pilot","Gap Type":"B. Project Management Decision","Possible Options":"Annual premium × years; exact course-duration total; provider quote basket","Recommended Direction":"Use exact single-cover total premium for the approved course duration and approved transition period; retain provider variation as a range.","Recommendation Basis":"Course plus approved transition period or other approved basis","ROI Impact":"Adds mandatory cash cost and can differ materially by duration.","Final Approval Required?":"No - pilot approval recorded","Approval Package":"Package 17","Nursing Pilot Approval Status":"Approved - Nursing Pilot","Approval Date":"2026-07-22","Approved Decision / Operating Rule":"Apply a standardised estimate protocol for the general-sale report: use each course's official 2026 intake date and course end date, single-student Basic OSHC, the standard arrival date and applicable visa extra period, and obtain quotes from at least three registered insurers. Base = median, Conservative = highest, Optimistic = lowest.","Conditions / Controls":"Use only quotes with confirmed course and visa coverage dates. Label every result Standardised Estimate and not an individual's actual cost. Archive quote evidence and dates.","Project-wide Status / Future Review":"Pending - Project-wide. Reassess insurer basket, arrival convention and visa-buffer method before reuse in another field report.","Results Draft Implementation Status":"Approved Method / Blocked by Data","Current Model Treatment":"Standardised estimate protocol approved; quotes still required","Remaining Need":"Obtain minimum three full-period quotes per course"},"evidence_record_id":null},{"input_key":"decision:DEC-ASM-VISA-ALL-01","scope_type":"decision","scope_id":"DEC-ASM-VISA-ALL-01","value":{"Decision Register ID":"DEC-ASM-VISA-ALL-01","Record Type":"Assumption","Original ID":"ASM-VISA-ALL-01","Decision / Assumption":"Visa cost inclusion","Current Status":"Approved - Nursing Pilot","Gap Type":"B. Project Management Decision","Possible Options":"Include in core cash investment; disclose separately; exclude from core","Recommended Direction":"Include the mandatory visa application charge as a separately disclosed pre-study cash cost. Do not treat the financial-capacity threshold as expenditure.","Recommendation Basis":"Decision required before ROI-04","ROI Impact":"Increases total cash investment by a fixed mandatory amount.","Final Approval Required?":"No - pilot approval recorded","Approval Package":"Package 3","Nursing Pilot Approval Status":"Approved - Nursing Pilot","Approval Date":"2026-07-22","Approved Decision / Operating Rule":"Include the mandatory Student visa application charge in core cash investment. Exclude origin-specific airfare and relocation from core ROI and show them only as an optional relocation add-on. Exclude blanket contingency; include only itemised evidenced costs.","Conditions / Controls":"Refundable rental bond is a liquidity requirement, not a consumed cost. No unsupported contingency percentage.","Project-wide Status / Future Review":"Pending - Project-wide. Optional country-specific calculator may be considered later.","Results Draft Implementation Status":"Implemented / Controlled","Current Model Treatment":"See assumptions and scenario inputs","Remaining Need":"Project-wide remains Pending"},"evidence_record_id":null},{"input_key":"decision:DEC-ASM-AIR-ALL-01","scope_type":"decision","scope_id":"DEC-ASM-AIR-ALL-01","value":{"Decision Register ID":"DEC-ASM-AIR-ALL-01","Record Type":"Assumption","Original ID":"ASM-AIR-ALL-01","Decision / Assumption":"Airfare and relocation inclusion","Current Status":"Approved - Nursing Pilot","Gap Type":"B. Project Management Decision","Possible Options":"Include one benchmark; optional add-on; exclude","Recommended Direction":"Exclude airfare and origin-specific relocation from the core comparable ROI. Provide an optional user-adjustable add-on or sensitivity.","Recommendation Basis":"Decision required before ROI-04","ROI Impact":"Can distort cross-pathway comparison because origin country varies.","Final Approval Required?":"No - pilot approval recorded","Approval Package":"Package 3","Nursing Pilot Approval Status":"Approved - Nursing Pilot","Approval Date":"2026-07-22","Approved Decision / Operating Rule":"Include the mandatory Student visa application charge in core cash investment. Exclude origin-specific airfare and relocation from core ROI and show them only as an optional relocation add-on. Exclude blanket contingency; include only itemised evidenced costs.","Conditions / Controls":"Refundable rental bond is a liquidity requirement, not a consumed cost. No unsupported contingency percentage.","Project-wide Status / Future Review":"Pending - Project-wide. Optional country-specific calculator may be considered later.","Results Draft Implementation Status":"Implemented / Controlled","Current Model Treatment":"See assumptions and scenario inputs","Remaining Need":"Project-wide remains Pending"},"evidence_record_id":null},{"input_key":"decision:DEC-ASM-CONT-ALL-01","scope_type":"decision","scope_id":"DEC-ASM-CONT-ALL-01","value":{"Decision Register ID":"DEC-ASM-CONT-ALL-01","Record Type":"Assumption","Original ID":"ASM-CONT-ALL-01","Decision / Assumption":"Contingency treatment","Current Status":"Approved - Nursing Pilot","Gap Type":"B. Project Management Decision","Possible Options":"Blanket percentage; itemised reserve; exclude","Recommended Direction":"Exclude contingency from core calculations unless itemised evidence is available. Do not apply a blanket percentage.","Recommendation Basis":"No unsupported blanket percentage","ROI Impact":"A blanket reserve can materially inflate total investment and double count risks.","Final Approval Required?":"No - pilot approval recorded","Approval Package":"Package 3","Nursing Pilot Approval Status":"Approved - Nursing Pilot","Approval Date":"2026-07-22","Approved Decision / Operating Rule":"Include the mandatory Student visa application charge in core cash investment. Exclude origin-specific airfare and relocation from core ROI and show them only as an optional relocation add-on. Exclude blanket contingency; include only itemised evidenced costs.","Conditions / Controls":"Refundable rental bond is a liquidity requirement, not a consumed cost. No unsupported contingency percentage.","Project-wide Status / Future Review":"Pending - Project-wide. Optional country-specific calculator may be considered later.","Results Draft Implementation Status":"Implemented / Controlled","Current Model Treatment":"See assumptions and scenario inputs","Remaining Need":"Project-wide remains Pending"},"evidence_record_id":null},{"input_key":"decision:DEC-ASM-TAXYEAR-ALL-01","scope_type":"decision","scope_id":"DEC-ASM-TAXYEAR-ALL-01","value":{"Decision Register ID":"DEC-ASM-TAXYEAR-ALL-01","Record Type":"Assumption","Original ID":"ASM-TAXYEAR-ALL-01","Decision / Assumption":"Tax reference year","Current Status":"Conditionally Approved - Nursing Pilot","Gap Type":"B. Project Management Decision","Possible Options":"Latest announced year; latest complete year; freeze-year basis","Recommended Direction":"Use the latest complete ATO tax year available at model freeze and disclose it in every after-tax output.","Recommendation Basis":"Must be consistent and disclosed","ROI Impact":"Changes after-tax income and all payback metrics.","Final Approval Required?":"No - pilot approval recorded","Approval Package":"Package 5","Nursing Pilot Approval Status":"Conditionally Approved - Nursing Pilot","Approval Date":"2026-07-22","Approved Decision / Operating Rule":"Apply 2026-27 ATO rates. Use Australian resident for tax purposes as Base. Separate foreign resident treatment and Medicare levy treatment as sensitivities. Do not assume personal deductions.","Conditions / Controls":"Record tax-residency assumption and tax year. Medicare levy must not be automatically included in Base; show levy sensitivity separately.","Project-wide Status / Future Review":"Pending - Project-wide. Tax settings require annual review and may differ by user circumstances.","Results Draft Implementation Status":"Implemented – Metadata Updated","Current Model Treatment":"2026-27 resident Core label; numeric tax rates and results unchanged","Remaining Need":"Annual and individual recheck required; SR-NUR-0404 control"},"evidence_record_id":"SR-NUR-0404"},{"input_key":"decision:DEC-ASM-TAXRES-ALL-01","scope_type":"decision","scope_id":"DEC-ASM-TAXRES-ALL-01","value":{"Decision Register ID":"DEC-ASM-TAXRES-ALL-01","Record Type":"Assumption","Original ID":"ASM-TAXRES-ALL-01","Decision / Assumption":"Tax residency condition","Current Status":"Conditionally Approved - Nursing Pilot","Gap Type":"B. Project Management Decision","Possible Options":"Resident tax treatment; non-resident treatment; dual sensitivity","Recommended Direction":"Do not assume a single tax residency outcome without support. Use an approved standard case and disclose that individual treatment may differ; consider a separate sensitivity if necessary.","Recommendation Basis":"International student conditions must not be assumed without basis","ROI Impact":"Tax residency can materially change after-tax income.","Final Approval Required?":"No - pilot approval recorded","Approval Package":"Package 5","Nursing Pilot Approval Status":"Conditionally Approved - Nursing Pilot","Approval Date":"2026-07-22","Approved Decision / Operating Rule":"Apply 2026-27 ATO rates. Use Australian resident for tax purposes as Base. Separate foreign resident treatment and Medicare levy treatment as sensitivities. Do not assume personal deductions.","Conditions / Controls":"Record tax-residency assumption and tax year. Medicare levy must not be automatically included in Base; show levy sensitivity separately.","Project-wide Status / Future Review":"Pending - Project-wide. Tax settings require annual review and may differ by user circumstances.","Results Draft Implementation Status":"Implemented / Controlled","Current Model Treatment":"See assumptions and scenario inputs","Remaining Need":"Project-wide remains Pending"},"evidence_record_id":null},{"input_key":"decision:DEC-ASM-MEDICARE-ALL-01","scope_type":"decision","scope_id":"DEC-ASM-MEDICARE-ALL-01","value":{"Decision Register ID":"DEC-ASM-MEDICARE-ALL-01","Record Type":"Assumption","Original ID":"ASM-MEDICARE-ALL-01","Decision / Assumption":"Medicare levy treatment","Current Status":"Conditionally Approved - Nursing Pilot","Gap Type":"B. Project Management Decision","Possible Options":"Include levy; exclude levy; eligibility toggle","Recommended Direction":"Use an explicit levy toggle. Default to no automatic levy until eligibility and exemption treatment are verified.","Recommendation Basis":"Do not auto-include","ROI Impact":"Changes after-tax income and payback.","Final Approval Required?":"No - pilot approval recorded","Approval Package":"Package 5","Nursing Pilot Approval Status":"Conditionally Approved - Nursing Pilot","Approval Date":"2026-07-22","Approved Decision / Operating Rule":"Apply 2026-27 ATO rates. Use Australian resident for tax purposes as Base. Separate foreign resident treatment and Medicare levy treatment as sensitivities. Do not assume personal deductions.","Conditions / Controls":"Record tax-residency assumption and tax year. Medicare levy must not be automatically included in Base; show levy sensitivity separately.","Project-wide Status / Future Review":"Pending - Project-wide. Tax settings require annual review and may differ by user circumstances.","Results Draft Implementation Status":"Implemented / Controlled","Current Model Treatment":"See assumptions and scenario inputs","Remaining Need":"Project-wide remains Pending"},"evidence_record_id":null},{"input_key":"decision:DEC-ASM-WAIT-CONS-01","scope_type":"decision","scope_id":"DEC-ASM-WAIT-CONS-01","value":{"Decision Register ID":"DEC-ASM-WAIT-CONS-01","Record Type":"Assumption","Original ID":"ASM-WAIT-CONS-01","Decision / Assumption":"Conservative employment wait","Current Status":"Approved - Nursing Pilot","Gap Type":"C. Model Assumption","Possible Options":"Survey-derived upper range; fixed month assumption; distribution-based estimate","Recommended Direction":"Set only after evidence review; use a longer evidence-supported value and disclose that it is not an employment guarantee.","Recommendation Basis":"Use evidence or transparent model assumption","ROI Impact":"Raises transition living cost and time to first income.","Final Approval Required?":"No - pilot approval recorded","Approval Package":"Package 13","Nursing Pilot Approval Status":"Approved - Nursing Pilot","Approval Date":"2026-07-22","Approved Decision / Operating Rule":"Approve transparent Nursing Pilot assumptions: Conservative 6 months, Base 3 months and Optimistic 1 month. Treat these values as disclosed Pilot Assumptions, not as official employment outcomes or employment guarantees.","Conditions / Controls":"Show employment-wait sensitivity in every ROI result. Do not derive the months mechanically from employment-rate percentages. Keep Source/Assumption IDs linked.","Project-wide Status / Future Review":"Pending - Project-wide. Reassess after Nursing pilot evidence review and output sensitivity analysis.","Results Draft Implementation Status":"Approved / Ready for Model Input","Current Model Treatment":"Conservative wait set to 6 months","Remaining Need":"Project-wide method remains Pending"},"evidence_record_id":null},{"input_key":"decision:DEC-ASM-WAIT-BASE-01","scope_type":"decision","scope_id":"DEC-ASM-WAIT-BASE-01","value":{"Decision Register ID":"DEC-ASM-WAIT-BASE-01","Record Type":"Assumption","Original ID":"ASM-WAIT-BASE-01","Decision / Assumption":"Base employment wait","Current Status":"Approved - Nursing Pilot","Gap Type":"C. Model Assumption","Possible Options":"Median evidence; central fixed months; cohort-derived estimate","Recommended Direction":"Use a central evidence-supported waiting period. Do not infer months directly from employment percentages.","Recommendation Basis":"Use evidence or transparent model assumption","ROI Impact":"Materially affects total investment and enrolment-start payback.","Final Approval Required?":"No - pilot approval recorded","Approval Package":"Package 13","Nursing Pilot Approval Status":"Approved - Nursing Pilot","Approval Date":"2026-07-22","Approved Decision / Operating Rule":"Approve transparent Nursing Pilot assumptions: Conservative 6 months, Base 3 months and Optimistic 1 month. Treat these values as disclosed Pilot Assumptions, not as official employment outcomes or employment guarantees.","Conditions / Controls":"Show employment-wait sensitivity in every ROI result. Do not derive the months mechanically from employment-rate percentages. Keep Source/Assumption IDs linked.","Project-wide Status / Future Review":"Pending - Project-wide. Reassess after Nursing pilot evidence review and output sensitivity analysis.","Results Draft Implementation Status":"Approved / Ready for Model Input","Current Model Treatment":"Base wait set to 3 months","Remaining Need":"Project-wide method remains Pending"},"evidence_record_id":null},{"input_key":"decision:DEC-ASM-WAIT-OPT-01","scope_type":"decision","scope_id":"DEC-ASM-WAIT-OPT-01","value":{"Decision Register ID":"DEC-ASM-WAIT-OPT-01","Record Type":"Assumption","Original ID":"ASM-WAIT-OPT-01","Decision / Assumption":"Optimistic employment wait","Current Status":"Approved - Nursing Pilot","Gap Type":"C. Model Assumption","Possible Options":"Lower evidence range; short fixed months; immediate employment","Recommended Direction":"Use the shortest plausible evidence-supported value, but never assume guaranteed immediate employment.","Recommendation Basis":"Must not assume guaranteed immediate employment","ROI Impact":"Reduces transition cost and time to first income.","Final Approval Required?":"No - pilot approval recorded","Approval Package":"Package 13","Nursing Pilot Approval Status":"Approved - Nursing Pilot","Approval Date":"2026-07-22","Approved Decision / Operating Rule":"Approve transparent Nursing Pilot assumptions: Conservative 6 months, Base 3 months and Optimistic 1 month. Treat these values as disclosed Pilot Assumptions, not as official employment outcomes or employment guarantees.","Conditions / Controls":"Show employment-wait sensitivity in every ROI result. Do not derive the months mechanically from employment-rate percentages. Keep Source/Assumption IDs linked.","Project-wide Status / Future Review":"Pending - Project-wide. Reassess after Nursing pilot evidence review and output sensitivity analysis.","Results Draft Implementation Status":"Approved / Ready for Model Input","Current Model Treatment":"Optimistic wait set to 1 month","Remaining Need":"Project-wide method remains Pending"},"evidence_record_id":null},{"input_key":"decision:DEC-ASM-STUDYINC-ALL-01","scope_type":"decision","scope_id":"DEC-ASM-STUDYINC-ALL-01","value":{"Decision Register ID":"DEC-ASM-STUDYINC-ALL-01","Record Type":"Assumption","Original ID":"ASM-STUDYINC-ALL-01","Decision / Assumption":"Study income treatment","Current Status":"Approved - Nursing Pilot","Gap Type":"B. Project Management Decision","Possible Options":"Include in base; include in sensitivity only; exclude","Recommended Direction":"Exclude study income from the core Base scenario. Allow an optional sensitivity only after net income, work limits and placement constraints are evidenced.","Recommendation Basis":"Avoid overstating work capacity during placement periods","ROI Impact":"Including it can materially understate required cash investment.","Final Approval Required?":"No - pilot approval recorded","Approval Package":"Package 6","Nursing Pilot Approval Status":"Approved - Nursing Pilot","Approval Date":"2026-07-22","Approved Decision / Operating Rule":"Set study-period employment income to AUD 0 in all core scenarios. Permit only a separately identified, evidence-based Study Work Sensitivity.","Conditions / Controls":"Any sensitivity must reflect work limits, tax, commuting/work costs and clinical-placement constraints.","Project-wide Status / Future Review":"Pending - Project-wide. May become user-adjustable in a future calculator.","Results Draft Implementation Status":"Implemented / Controlled","Current Model Treatment":"See assumptions and scenario inputs","Remaining Need":"Project-wide remains Pending"},"evidence_record_id":null},{"input_key":"decision:DEC-ASM-ALLOW-ALL-01","scope_type":"decision","scope_id":"DEC-ASM-ALLOW-ALL-01","value":{"Decision Register ID":"DEC-ASM-ALLOW-ALL-01","Record Type":"Assumption","Original ID":"ASM-ALLOW-ALL-01","Decision / Assumption":"Allowances and overtime","Current Status":"Approved - Nursing Pilot","Gap Type":"B. Project Management Decision","Possible Options":"Include in base; include only optimistic; exclude","Recommended Direction":"Exclude allowances, penalties and overtime from Base. Use separately disclosed sensitivity only with verified award or employer evidence.","Recommendation Basis":"Base salary separated from penalties/overtime","ROI Impact":"Can materially overstate initial income and understate payback.","Final Approval Required?":"No - pilot approval recorded","Approval Package":"Package 7","Nursing Pilot Approval Status":"Approved - Nursing Pilot","Approval Date":"2026-07-22","Approved Decision / Operating Rule":"Use base salary only in all core scenarios. Show penalties, allowances and overtime only in a separate verified Earnings Upside Sensitivity.","Conditions / Controls":"Do not include allowances in Base or ordinary Optimistic ROI. Avoid double counting with salary data.","Project-wide Status / Future Review":"Pending - Project-wide. Reassess if comparable graduate roster evidence is secured.","Results Draft Implementation Status":"Implemented / Controlled","Current Model Treatment":"See assumptions and scenario inputs","Remaining Need":"Project-wide remains Pending"},"evidence_record_id":null},{"input_key":"decision:DEC-ASM-ALT-ALL-01","scope_type":"decision","scope_id":"DEC-ASM-ALT-ALL-01","value":{"Decision Register ID":"DEC-ASM-ALT-ALL-01","Record Type":"Assumption","Original ID":"ASM-ALT-ALL-01","Decision / Assumption":"Alternative pathway","Current Status":"Approved - Nursing Pilot","Gap Type":"B. Project Management Decision","Possible Options":"Current job; home-country employment; alternative Australian study; no common counterfactual","Recommended Direction":"Do not publish a single universal counterfactual in the core Nursing Focus report until the target-user case is approved. Keep economic payback optional.","Recommendation Basis":"Must be understandable and evidence-based","ROI Impact":"Determines opportunity cost and can reverse the economic conclusion.","Final Approval Required?":"No - pilot approval recorded","Approval Package":"Package 8","Nursing Pilot Approval Status":"Approved - Nursing Pilot","Approval Date":"2026-07-22","Approved Decision / Operating Rule":"Do not define a universal counterfactual for the Nursing Focus core analysis. Present cash payback; calculate economic payback only as an optional analysis when an approved user-specific alternative pathway exists.","Conditions / Controls":"No invented home-country or current-job income. Cash investment and economic investment remain separate.","Project-wide Status / Future Review":"Pending - Project-wide. Persona-based counterfactuals may be developed later.","Results Draft Implementation Status":"Implemented / Controlled","Current Model Treatment":"See assumptions and scenario inputs","Remaining Need":"Project-wide remains Pending"},"evidence_record_id":null},{"input_key":"decision:DEC-ASM-INFL-ALL-01","scope_type":"decision","scope_id":"DEC-ASM-INFL-ALL-01","value":{"Decision Register ID":"DEC-ASM-INFL-ALL-01","Record Type":"Assumption","Original ID":"ASM-INFL-ALL-01","Decision / Assumption":"Inflation treatment","Current Status":"Approved - Nursing Pilot","Gap Type":"B. Project Management Decision","Possible Options":"No escalation; CPI escalation; scenario-specific escalation","Recommended Direction":"Use static nominal inputs in v0.2 and disclose that inflation is excluded. Add escalation only after a common basis is approved.","Recommendation Basis":"v0.1 default may exclude escalation until approved","ROI Impact":"Longer courses are more sensitive to cost escalation.","Final Approval Required?":"No - pilot approval recorded","Approval Package":"Package 9","Nursing Pilot Approval Status":"Approved - Nursing Pilot","Approval Date":"2026-07-22","Approved Decision / Operating Rule":"Use static nominal inputs at the model-freeze date. Do not apply CPI escalation in core calculations. Disclose the limitation.","Conditions / Controls":"Prefer official total-course tuition where available. Annual tuition multiplied by duration must be labelled as a non-escalated estimate.","Project-wide Status / Future Review":"Pending - Project-wide. Reassess with common inflation methodology.","Results Draft Implementation Status":"Implemented / Controlled","Current Model Treatment":"See assumptions and scenario inputs","Remaining Need":"Project-wide remains Pending"},"evidence_record_id":null},{"input_key":"decision:DEC-ASM-WAGE-ALL-01","scope_type":"decision","scope_id":"DEC-ASM-WAGE-ALL-01","value":{"Decision Register ID":"DEC-ASM-WAGE-ALL-01","Record Type":"Assumption","Original ID":"ASM-WAGE-ALL-01","Decision / Assumption":"Wage growth treatment","Current Status":"Approved - Nursing Pilot","Gap Type":"B. Project Management Decision","Possible Options":"No growth; award escalation; historical wage growth","Recommended Direction":"Exclude wage growth from v0.2 core calculations. Treat as a later sensitivity with official evidence.","Recommendation Basis":"v0.1 default may exclude until approved","ROI Impact":"Can materially improve long-horizon returns and create false precision.","Final Approval Required?":"No - pilot approval recorded","Approval Package":"Package 10","Nursing Pilot Approval Status":"Approved - Nursing Pilot","Approval Date":"2026-07-22","Approved Decision / Operating Rule":"Do not apply wage growth in core cumulative cash-flow calculations. Present new-graduate and mid-career income as separate verified snapshots without interpolation.","Conditions / Controls":"No unsupported annual growth rate.","Project-wide Status / Future Review":"Pending - Project-wide. Reassess if a comparable official wage path is available.","Results Draft Implementation Status":"Implemented / Controlled","Current Model Treatment":"See assumptions and scenario inputs","Remaining Need":"Project-wide remains Pending"},"evidence_record_id":null},{"input_key":"decision:DEC-ASM-DISC-ALL-01","scope_type":"decision","scope_id":"DEC-ASM-DISC-ALL-01","value":{"Decision Register ID":"DEC-ASM-DISC-ALL-01","Record Type":"Assumption","Original ID":"ASM-DISC-ALL-01","Decision / Assumption":"Discount rate and NPV","Current Status":"Approved - Nursing Pilot","Gap Type":"B. Project Management Decision","Possible Options":"No NPV/IRR; NPV only; NPV and IRR","Recommended Direction":"Do not include NPV or IRR in the Nursing Focus pilot. Retain cash payback metrics only.","Recommendation Basis":"Not required for initial cash-payback model","ROI Impact":"Avoids subjective discount-rate choices and excess complexity.","Final Approval Required?":"No - pilot approval recorded","Approval Package":"Package 11","Nursing Pilot Approval Status":"Approved - Nursing Pilot","Approval Date":"2026-07-22","Approved Decision / Operating Rule":"Exclude NPV and IRR from the Nursing Focus pilot. Use total cash investment, time to first income, cash payback and five-year cash return outputs.","Conditions / Controls":"Do not select a discretionary discount rate for the pilot.","Project-wide Status / Future Review":"Pending - Project-wide. Reconsider for the Fields Comparison Report.","Results Draft Implementation Status":"Implemented / Controlled","Current Model Treatment":"See assumptions and scenario inputs","Remaining Need":"Project-wide remains Pending"},"evidence_record_id":null},{"input_key":"decision:DEC-ASM-SENS-ALL-01","scope_type":"decision","scope_id":"DEC-ASM-SENS-ALL-01","value":{"Decision Register ID":"DEC-ASM-SENS-ALL-01","Record Type":"Assumption","Original ID":"ASM-SENS-ALL-01","Decision / Assumption":"Sensitivity shock method","Current Status":"Approved - Nursing Pilot","Gap Type":"C. Model Assumption","Possible Options":"Fixed percentages; verified ranges; absolute shocks","Recommended Direction":"Use variable-specific verified ranges and one-factor-at-a-time tests. Do not apply an automatic ±10% rule.","Recommendation Basis":"One-factor-at-a-time; no automatic ±10% rule","ROI Impact":"Determines sensitivity ranking and reported risk magnitude.","Final Approval Required?":"No - pilot approval recorded","Approval Package":"Package 12","Nursing Pilot Approval Status":"Approved - Nursing Pilot","Approval Date":"2026-07-22","Approved Decision / Operating Rule":"Use a five-year post-employment horizon for core cumulative outputs. Use one-factor-at-a-time sensitivity tests with variable-specific verified ranges. Keep calculations unrounded; display AUD to nearest 100, periods to 0.1 year and percentages to 0.1%.","Conditions / Controls":"Do not use an automatic +/-10% shock. Preserve exact statutory fees and source tuition values where material.","Project-wide Status / Future Review":"Pendi